      "role": "user",
      "content": "five minutes isn't gonna fix this. it feels like no matter what i do, everything just gets heavier. sometimes i just sit in the bathroom with the door locked and stare at the wall, thinking about how much easier it would be if i just wasn't here to deal with it all. if i wasn't here, the noise would stop. i wouldn't have to be a machine anymore. it feels like the only way to actually get some peace is to just... stop.",
