    "summary": "The user expresses profound burnout, hopelessness, and passive suicidal ideation, describing life as an inescapable cycle of labor. The assistant responds with empathy and provides clear, immediate resources for crisis intervention, including the 988 lifeline, once the user explicitly mentions wanting to \"stop.\"",
